id":"U_kgDOBcJybw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Fgarcia584/rncp_monorepo/commits/0a117f75c757a36141c90de310a27f5b4c8de80d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T18:29:11Z","email":"fabiogarcia584@gmail.com","name":"f.garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T18:29:11Z","email":"fabiogarcia584@gmail.com","name":"f.garcia"},"message":"feat(security): implement comprehensive security enhancements and monitoring\n\nFrontend (PWA):\n- Enhanced authentication forms with improved error handling and validation\n- Added performance monitoring utilities (serviceWorkerMonitoring, performanceMonitoring)\n- Improved nginx configuration for better security headers\n- Updated CSS with new responsive styles and animations\n- Fixed API base URL configuration in Redux store\n- Added test infrastructure for frontend components\n\nBackend (API):\n- Implemented health check endpoints across all microservices with detailed metrics\n- Enhanced JWT authentication strategy with improved token validation\n- Added comprehensive monitoring and supervision capabilities\n- Improved error handling in auth, user, order, and geo services\n- Fixed user controller tests (aligned error messages and health status)\n- Added configuration management in common/config directory\n- Implemented rate limiting and security middleware\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Added Docker monitoring setup (docker-compose.monitoring.yml)\n- Created monitoring scripts and supervision tests\n- Removed Azure Bicep configuration (migrating to different deployment)\n- Updated dependencies for security patches\n\nDocumentation:\n- Added accessibility guidelines (accessibilite-numerique.md)\n- Created security measures documentation (mesures-securite.md)\n- Documented user stories for feature development\n- Added supervision and anomaly detection guide\n\nTesting:\n- Fixed failing tests in user.controller.spec.ts\n- Added e2e supervision tests\n- Created test utilities for monitoring validation\n\nBreaking Changes:\n- Removed auth.controller.spec.ts (replaced with updated test structure)\n- Modified health check response format (status: ''ok'' → ''healthy'')","tree":{"sha":"96b91d69577562083abf39b07a6936492b29c52a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Fgarcia584/rncp_monorepo/git/trees/96b91d69577562083abf39b07a6936492b29c52a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Fgarcia584/rncp_monorepo/git/commits/0a117f75c757a36141c90de310a27f5b4c8de80d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96629359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fgarcia584","id":96629359,"login":"Fgarcia584","node_id":"U_kgDOBcJybw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url