ser","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Fgarcia584/rncp_monorepo/commits/d2c80f6ef69d5961b6fcdcc7c45d74306a324351/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-22T10:09:25Z","email":"fabiogarcia584@gmail.com","name":"f.garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-22T10:09:25Z","email":"fabiogarcia584@gmail.com","name":"f.garcia"},"message":"feat: add comprehensive OWASP Top 10 security analysis\n\nAdded detailed security analysis report covering all OWASP Top 10 2021 vulnerabilities:\n\nCritical Issues Identified:\n- Hardcoded JWT secrets in configuration files\n- Insecure token storage in localStorage (XSS vulnerable)\n- Debug endpoints exposed in production\n- Weak password requirements (6 chars minimum)\n\nMedium Risk Issues:\n- Missing rate limiting implementation\n- Incomplete security headers\n- Information disclosure in error messages\n\nGood Security Practices Found:\n- Strong bcrypt password hashing (12 rounds)\n- Global input validation with whitelist\n- SQL injection prevention with TypeORM\n- Role-based access control implementation\n- Container security with non-root users\n\nSecurity Score: 6.5/10\nIncludes prioritized action plan for immediate and long-term fixes.","tree":{"sha":"1aee3c3aab20a08efe0334b75e818f5fc3d8bfec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Fgarcia584/rncp_monorepo/git/trees/1aee3c3aab20a08efe0334b75e818f5fc3d8bfec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Fgarcia584/rncp_monorepo/git/commits/d2c80f6ef69d5961b6fcdcc7c45d74306a324351","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96629359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fgarcia584/following{/other_user}","gists_url"