enses.\n- Added data processing logic to aggregate transactions by month and categorize them as income or expense.\n- Created a responsive chart layout with tooltips and legends for better user experience.\n\nfeat: create AuthContext for user authentication management\n\n- Established an AuthContext to manage user authentication state across the application.\n- Implemented user state management with hooks, including a logout function.\n- Provided a custom hook, useAuth, for easy access to authentication context in components.","tree":{"sha":"a47d552749e2379d78000aeb9e66d9dfcf10cd4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/ByteBankMicroFrontEnd/git/trees/a47d552749e2379d78000aeb9e66d9dfcf10cd4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/ByteBankMicroFrontEnd/git/commits/af214e5a4eab53d78a09c57d108444d89681a0af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37852713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeticiaRosa","id":37852713,"login":"LeticiaRosa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3ODUyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LeticiaRosa/ByteBankMicroFrontEnd/commit/af2