eticia Rosa"},"message":"feat: implement transaction filtering and pagination in Extrato component\n\n- Added TransactionFilter component for filtering transactions by type, category, recipient, and amount.\n- Integrated filtering logic into the Extrato component, allowing users to apply and clear filters.\n- Implemented pagination for transactions, displaying a limited number of transactions per page.\n- Added infinite scroll functionality to load more transactions as the user scrolls.\n- Updated ItemExtrato component to display transaction details and actions (edit, delete).\n- Enhanced ContaContext to support filtering and grouping transactions by month.\n- Created utility functions for transaction categories and types.\n- Added LoadingSpinner component for loading states during data fetching.\n- Updated global styles for consistent card sizing.\n- Refactored transaction data structure to use a unified Transaction type.","tree":{"sha":"2267a3438063f144159107172de374382cbac0c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/ByteBankMicroFrontEnd/git/trees/2267a3438063f144159107172de374382cbac0c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeticiaRosa/ByteBankMicroFrontEnd/git/commits/4763c132253aefe0f20d0638f68848fc3b721e24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37852713?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeticiaRosa","id":37852713,"login":"LeticiaRosa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3ODUyNzEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeticiaRosa/received_event