sting\n- Add component metadata (name, props, dependencies)\n\nFrontend safety fixes:\n- Login/Register pages: Add safe data extraction with validation\n- Workspace page: Add array safety for messages, safe data extraction\n- ComponentPreview: Add prop defaults and type checking\n- ChatMessage: Add message object safety checks\n- SessionList: Add prop defaults and date validation\n- API utils: Add try-catch in response interceptor\n- Auth store: Add object safety in updateUser function\n\nAll pages now have:\n- Proper null/undefined checks\n- Array safety for .slice(), .map(), etc.\n- Safe object property access with optional chaining\n- Default values for props and parameters\n- Error logging for debugging\n- Graceful error handling\n\nThis prevents all client-side JavaScript errors like ''x.slice is not a function'', ''Cannot read property of undefined'', etc.","tree":{"sha":"b7c20b5f1a46e01b753a19733e359d8267d7acd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VIKASRAPARTHI/Component-and-Multi-Component-Generator/git/trees/b7c20b5f1a46e01b753a19733e359d8267d7acd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VIKASRAPARTHI/Component-and-Multi-Component-Generator/git/commits/b0e06529831bd06e254c061348e24f7ac2c0e4a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115341123?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VIKASRAPARTHI/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VIKASRAPARTHI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VIKASRAPARTHI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VIKASRAPARTHI/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VIKASRAPARTHI","id":115341123,"login":"VIKASRAPARTHI","node_id":"U_kgDOBt_3Qw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VIKASRAPARTHI/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VIKASRAPARTHI/received_events","repos_ur