","name":"Mykhailo Safronov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-30T09:35:52Z","email":"isevenpwnz@gmail.com","name":"Mykhailo Safronov"},"message":"feat: Comprehensive testing suite and professional documentation\n\n🧪 Testing Infrastructure:\n\nBackend Tests (Python/FastAPI):\n✅ Unit tests for PDF, Storage, and AI services\n✅ Integration tests for API endpoints\n✅ Comprehensive mocking of external dependencies\n✅ Coverage-focused test scenarios\n✅ Pytest configuration with proper markers\n\nFrontend Tests (Vue 3/TypeScript):\n✅ Composable tests (useApi, useFileUpload)\n✅ Utility function tests (formatters)\n✅ Vitest setup with jsdom environment\n✅ Mock fetch and browser APIs\n✅ Component interaction testing\n\nTest Coverage:\n📊 Backend: >80% overall coverage target\n📊 Frontend: >75% overall coverage target\n📊 Critical paths: >90% coverage\n\n📚 Documentation Overhaul:\n\nProfessional README:\n✅ Concise, action-oriented structure\n✅ Clear quick start instructions\n✅ Organized development workflows\n✅ Professional API documentation table\n✅ Simplified architecture description\n✅ Focused troubleshooting section\n\nTesting Documentation:\n✅ Comprehensive testing guide (TESTING.md)\n✅ Backend and frontend test execution\n✅ Coverage reporting instructions\n✅ Best practices and patterns\n✅ CI/CD integration examples\n✅ Debugging and performance testing\n\nDependencies Added:\n🔧 Backend: pytest, pytest-asyncio, httpx, pytest-mock\n🔧 Frontend: @vue/test-utils, vitest, @vitest/ui, jsdom\n\nProject now includes enterprise-grade testing infrastructure with\ncomprehensive documentation for maintainable, scalable development.","tree":{"sha":"9db0c42a0136293e94065ddb1ca5a9d9d4203cf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iSevenpwnz/COXIT/git/trees/9db0c42a0136293e94065ddb1ca5a9d9d4203cf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iSevenpwnz/COXIT/git/commits/3b88a966666350ce958fded2edf04ac1553125ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified