to-Refresh History:\n   - Automatic updates every 30 seconds\n   - No manual refresh needed\n   - Visual indicator for auto-refresh status\n   - Proper cleanup on component unmount\n\n4. 🎨 Enhanced UX Elements:\n   - Animated progress bar during processing\n   - Better visual feedback for uploads\n   - Improved error styling (warnings vs errors)\n   - Professional loading states\n\nBackend Improvements:\n✅ Added file hash calculation (SHA-256)\n✅ Enhanced PDF metadata model\n✅ Duplicate detection service\n✅ Custom DuplicateFileError exception\n✅ Proper HTTP status codes (409 for conflicts)\n\nFrontend Improvements:\n✅ Auto-refresh mechanism with cleanup\n✅ Original filename display in history\n✅ Progressive upload feedback\n✅ Enhanced error handling and styling\n✅ Better visual indicators\n\nArchitecture:\n✅ Maintained SOLID principles\n✅ Clean separation of concerns\n✅ Proper error handling hierarchy\n✅ Type-safe implementations throughout","tree":{"sha":"ae9d4749a700ec8405c9763c4f57dc667a66f197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iSevenpwnz/COXIT/git/trees/ae9d4749a700ec8405c9763c4f57dc667a66f197"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iSevenpwnz/COXIT/git/commits/ff9a600c22e2353889d613dedd69bd0c2f1a8092","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90797052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/iSevenpwnz","id":90797052,"login":"iSevenpwnz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNzk3MDUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/received_events","repos_url":"https://