I implementation\n\n- Add FastAPI backend with PDF parsing and OpenAI integration\n- Implement Vue.js frontend with drag-drop upload and history\n- Add Docker configuration for containerized deployment\n- Support PDF files up to 50MB/100 pages with images and tables\n- Generate AI summaries using GPT-4o-mini\n- Display last 5 processed documents with metadata\n- Add comprehensive documentation and setup instructions\n\nCore features:\n✅ PDF upload with validation\n✅ PDF parsing (text, images, tables)\n✅ AI summary generation via OpenAI API\n✅ Document history with summary viewing\n✅ Docker Compose setup for easy deployment\n✅ Complete documentation and troubleshooting","tree":{"sha":"a0f83d03a309688455f5be4ff302d879c4fcb67f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iSevenpwnz/COXIT/git/trees/a0f83d03a309688455f5be4ff302d879c4fcb67f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iSevenpwnz/COXIT/git/commits/384ecacaddefe6eee6a934c68ca7c65e358b470a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90797052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/iSevenpwnz","id":90797052,"login":"iSevenpwnz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNzk3MDUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSevenpwnz","us