etemp/echo-mind-orchestrator/commits/ffd7b243ed9a26fc1d7351d39d7b57245ddca1e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-30T09:10:02Z","email":"53593281+noctetemp@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nocte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-30T09:10:02Z","email":"53593281+noctetemp@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nocte"},"message":"Initial commit: Working Echo Mind Orchestrator\n\n✅ Features:\n- Real-time audio processing with Deepgram STT\n- OpenAI GPT-4 integration with function calling\n- meMOS memory system integration (Neo4j + vector search)\n- HeyGen avatar service integration\n- Multi-language support\n- Tool system: time, weather, web search, memory search\n- WebSocket audio streaming\n- FastAPI REST API\n\n🏗️ Architecture:\n- FastAPI orchestrator service\n- Custom streaming pipeline (streaming_pipeline.py)\n- Pipecat pipeline ready for migration (pipecat_pipeline.py)\n- meMOS integration for persistent memory\n- Production-ready with comprehensive logging\n\n📊 Status: Production ready, working end-to-end\n🔜 Next: Migration to Pipecat + SileroVAD for bulletproof audio","tree":{"sha":"05cb19a0c19cc45b3c35d0b0eddbb926701eb9af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/noctetemp/echo-mind-orchestrator/git/trees/05cb19a0c19cc45b3c35d0b0eddbb926701eb9af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/noctetemp/echo-mind-orchestrator/git/commits/ffd7b243ed9a26fc1d7351d39d7b57245ddca1e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53593281?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noctetemp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noctetemp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noctetemp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/noctetemp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/noctetemp","id":53593281,"login":"noctetemp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcj