tension-manager-operator/commits/ae95521210589015bb63c193d6002aa3dc55e1d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52737?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nexus49","id":52737,"login":"nexus49","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nexus49","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/extension-manager-operator/commits/18e8a97d810e166067d42c9d569787e8c13b4b25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T17:10:18Z","email":"bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com","name":"Bastian Echterhölter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T17:32:12Z","email":"bastian.echterhoelter@sap.com","name":"Bastian Echterhölter"},"message":"fix(ci): separate API release from main pipeline\n\nThe create-version job depended on two mutually exclusive jobs\n(create-version-with-api / create-version-without-api). GitHub Actions\nskips any job whose needs list includes a skipped job, so the entire\nrelease chain (docker-build-push, update-version, sbom, image-ocm)\nwas skipped on every push to main.\n\nInstead of working around the skipped-dependency behavior, separate\nthe concerns entirely:\n\n- pipeline.yml: main CI/CD without API detection logic — always runs\n  create-version (without apiPackagePath), docker build, and OCM