ithub.com/users/fred-labs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fred-labs","id":83823539,"login":"fred-labs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODIzNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/230d150029fbd7993e4022bad080c2b4bb9d527c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:32:49Z","email":"fred-labs@mailbox.org","name":"fred-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:32:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"RoboVAST 2.2.0 (#694)\n\nThe changelog''s 2.2.0 section: the changes a user of 2.1.0 must know about, citing the pull\nrequests that made them.\n\nThe five distributions carry 2.2.0, and the lock the siblings'' new version, so the images\nbuilt from this tree report the version they are tagged with. The developer guide says so:\nthe tree carries the version being released, and publish.yml stamps the tag''s version into\nthe wheels regardless.\n\nA test fixture spelled a machine-local home path as the absolute path a map must not name;\nit names a placeholder home now, and the test still asserts only that the path is absolute.","tree":{"sha":"6132cdb8c86a7f6f0ce4ed0f24b70173963ca50e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/trees/6132cdb8c86a7f6f0ce4ed0f24b70173963ca50e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/commits/230d150029fbd7993e4022bad080c2b4bb9d527c","verification":{"payload":"tree 6132cdb8c86a7f6f0ce4ed0f24b70173963ca50e\nparent 8651c9966723f9d269abe4e013286823b2ac15dd\nauthor fred-labs <fred-labs@mailbox.org> 1790263969 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790263969 +0200\n\nRoboVAST 2.2.0 (#694)\n\nThe changelog''s 2.2.0 section: the changes a user of 2.1.0 must know about, citing the pull\nrequests that made them.\n\nThe five distributions carry 2.2.0, and the lock the siblings'' new version, so the images\nbuilt from this tree report the version they are tagged with. The developer guide says so:\nthe tree carries the version being released, and publish.yml stamps the tag''s version into\nthe wheels regardless.\n\nA test fixture spelled a machine-local home path as the absolute path a map must not name;\nit names a placeholder home now, and the test still asserts only that the path is absolute.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtUKhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZ8wQAGKNu5V1wEilKu09RCagaHBY\nCHcYBJLeHG7CrjFtxqrAvDrHYd0RAOAc0pbI33C5NZrZbEnstjp11qFCXYpDFdh9\nNTIgx0txa2q1nTyHid4qucwgs4/jKeacslYg5UmcImqXPxR9Wrv1+HofnECNwV5M\nltwY1xAGWEClKKhcSQZCtDo6RZ84qc4pt85y37MSxBj9V3QcT2JHH5DajDHwFrH0\nR8rc7xnph4L0YRTSYqODNVEgYMp3ZYCDd/YRUJT4bK4eaf7DQSqcySL9ASccQNLi\n/H0Sge7OrpZym5+jb02PR1RgH/bAVQGKI909XRr8fuM/k9Orc9t1kS52qXl3wIT9\nlwALi5PZtS1s2g2uCRV6H6cGchXKZ6w92BmFOdeV05I81Wu/ILWJdF7mnZPcGeBR\ne+981T2tFeihy++w2+30L9LQpMZK0allLlgC7V8mNKzYUImPkGbP6WvjiAHvxTok\nCDbkwxgIyijps3lTcUoRet8YpNCOqZWuueJ/m/i11fNKoJR7hbZzp6/O/dGYwVue\nao7Wbvv7FI8nBf3PS0hJ+miFTKwpoPkyizTJ+F+XgqQEpLYTRNBr2KXICh5sykCS\nYlMURvQtJ2cqsiULkNYqynuTgfulsW0zQ4Yj0sxHArpFs8GWavm8nMkHEkKOmGwI\neY0Y1d3J5IBZicTSfQXw\n=DKRY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T15:32:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.git