n from.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtO04CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfXUQABCsePIOwu5pBWI8n+83qr+V\n6+azSHHl61B5BDiNQBhETmzydYM09Troem9zgRTQSHxKQ3qowD0QbK9vVp6rt9zb\nIR14HnWHYvvbxSPvDsQsbBqK8NlpgdQ6dPrzKxHLGv8GgIe7F/jS203MSGteuISC\nQBr79gOZ12utbJU1g/nTLRthbDhrwnhMjlD1186gFRw5U0nSbj7IrPo1oLMu4Mo7\nu6scupwrRxAVaObuwRAehASQ66MmhPCe1ZLfyxoYG6giTACjcPAEEbdWmed4nmmx\nmM3fg95oYLH4wU5driuq9vXKKiXBkG4UWtW5yNEfjEjBTYNPyV8oXidIS8SS/IIP\nkQwuMs5qgJRBSFRQFTRwwOBkOwNddidoheYxEfP3x+/2HXGaYRcp88S5dHh5Mp4E\njIkeYKQCjZBX696xG70LW4CFDWnijOztcppCyGXlh8+T/lF5Ul9HS1ho/Xu0r5be\nQ82wzfkiVson4/Dg9vKGhAOveYIi2pAgJAxA41ZtMt9DB5GgL/01Xn8lrqFYehrI\nkU/WK/ILBFTg31ZZ5uiYnSq1kK3W7RMXQGLJcYC6zNoQeRVgP2XYgpGHruS9s1bg\n+pTXg1FUCs4Hapdileua25+NrOj203aCqdu8RTW3W8iYKIAW+iMXnlK45EV3LnY2\ntkMDpFZVf+vSOjIuLJ7c\n=XBwL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T09:28:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cps-test-lab/robovast/commit/5f00f7af7cae8ee257d2a34625098cbea3b40bad","node_id":"C_kwDOPVaL7doAKDVmMDBmN2FmN2NhZThlZTI1N2QyYTM0NjI1MDk4Y2JlYTNiNDBiYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cps-test-lab/robovast/commit/f78f25817bd25bd49b88bb9164b6e802684bc917","sha":"f78f25817bd25bd49b88bb9164b6e802684bc917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/f78f25817bd25bd49b88bb9164b6e802684bc917"}],"sha":"5f00f7af7cae8ee257d2a34625098cbea3b40bad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/5f00f7af7cae8ee257d2a34625098cbea3b40bad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83823539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fred-labs","id":83823539,"login":"fred-labs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODIzNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/f78f25817bd25bd49b88bb9164b6e802684bc917/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:21:22Z","email":"fred-labs@mailbox.org","name":"fred-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:21:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"The catalog is what the command printed, not what its text spells (#685)\n\nAn image''s entrypoint announces the command it is about to run, so the command''s own text\nis on the stream ahead of that command''s output. A JSON object written in it is therefore\nthe first one a reader scanning from the front finds -- and it parses, and it has no\n``items``, so it flattens to an empty catalog reported as a successful one. The\ndocumentation search served a corpus missing its whole upstream half and said nothing.\n\nThe object the output ENDS with is the one the command printed: it is after everything\nechoed ahead of it, and it cannot be confused with a nested object inside the real\ndocument, which ends where the document does but starts later. An image that logs after\nits catalog falls back to the first object, which is right whenever nothing is echoed.\n\nThe documentation command no longer spells a JSON object at all, so neither rule has to\ncarry it alone, and a corpus that comes back empty is now reported rather than served:\na reply that merely lacks a half looks like a smaller corpus, and the question that half\nanswers comes back \"no match\".","tree":{"sha":"b4edf349580ba4a2caccb6f5c23af2ec946face9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/trees/b4edf349580ba4a2caccb6f5c23af2ec946face9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/commits/f78f25817bd25bd49b88bb9164b6e802684bc917","verification":{"payload":"tree b4edf349580ba4a2caccb6f5c23af2ec946face9\nparent 625f9a51e3782f5bc9a5f0f4568c09f4db81b4b6\nauthor fred-labs <fred-labs@mailbox.org> 1790241682 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790241682 +0200\n\nThe catalog is what the command printed, not what its text spells (#685)\n\nAn image''s entrypoint announces the command it is about to run, so the command''s own text\nis on the stream ahead of that command''s output. A JSON object written in it is therefore\nthe first one a reader scanning from the front finds -- and it parses, and it has no\n``items``, so it flattens to an empty catalog reported as a successful one. The\ndocumentation search served a corpus missing its whole upstream half and said nothing.\n\nThe object the output ENDS with is the one the command printed: it is after everything\nechoed ahead of it, and it cannot be confused with a nested object inside the real\ndocument, which ends where the document does but starts later. An image that logs after\nits catalog falls back to the first object, which is right whenever nothing is echoed.\n\nThe documentation command no longer spells a JSON object at all, so neither rule has to\ncarry it alone, and a corpus that comes back empty is now reported rather than served:\na reply that merely lacks a half looks like a smaller corpus, and the question that half\nanswers comes back \"no match\".","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtOuSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJ7MQACOo0FTm8ti+th8kXsQVMWo+\nzQUDJa6LsqZS/em/tqd961NiYNzLAqiwxzlmEgygcCXlTh0EuOq/dOlrhnvB0FqE\nXds2yYPFXO0vVFQDPDyTz1sjI6Olh5BwxQRWaMNEaaOwdeh1Q7eip2iPwVbtP9Tb\nPCfpj2gyNO9taMhYFImdVhWgFcKGpMfTU4YBJK7icZNAKKhiiPskqY9CjTp+6kJY\ng5jt4siG762a9ulzaCm7GzKxPfn5gVBFXfXCcKRG/f4/1szhYCLu53ddkrQYI6qN\ngQZbwmbSt+uTlAl1ji5/Pd1cVAcYG3tFsXuMoXq90EGpevhF0PZrlAzI8QysV/o2\nzRICxDrYvjmajs0hyKh7aMR4ZfISpW9wJH3isZV5HPKGRRko0/9oBh3MVi3ZEhjS\nWoyNTGGS25fRvYRiz5WjITxw5ciZyhwBZ0uO8yQuKJBnoqdAzUkqlWJF1sxLoRyM\ne3Z2GRNNQ5BbLCK1Tg3XOxSEjROXPtp3AGr4u/OKqq9wNJHbJDc/dNHsG7HWs509\nYxWB11RzUS7w0zRIz/DIW3Rzh7G2Pz6FUQGb+TIgruK88pIJ9GhEI2h5cIeaxG52\nW/rxQiK5fTqP9aljlwx4TTpZIzMW1wFWNT0pbaLAmgI62yBv1v8vYyG+3o6xoaLI\n9p7uyVMxj15a6FOcaRHr\n=vUvy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T09:21:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node