i.github.com/users/fred-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/625f9a51e3782f5bc9a5f0f4568c09f4db81b4b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:11:55Z","email":"fred-labs@mailbox.org","name":"fred-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:11:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Document release image tags; state the tag default''s reason as it holds now (#684)\n\nThe pinning section said to publish an immutable tag but not that every\nrelease already is one: CI publishes the whole family under the version\nwithout its `v`, plus a `major.minor` tag that moves with each patch\nrelease. Say which to pin, and that the installed `vast` never chooses\nthe tag, so installing a release does not move the images.\n\nThe docstrings around the family''s project and tag defaults explained\nthemselves through the code they replaced; they now state the reason\nthat holds today.","tree":{"sha":"0a866840acc02e5d2c8128dad41e18bbb0a03722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/trees/0a866840acc02e5d2c8128dad41e18bbb0a03722"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/commits/625f9a51e3782f5bc9a5f0f4568c09f4db81b4b6","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a866840acc02e5d2c8128dad41e18bbb0a03722\nparent ea54d2bc228c39cfd69c36c17a2a1b3ade677c55\nauthor fred-labs <fred-labs@mailbox.org> 1790241115 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790241115 +0200\n\nDocument release image tags; state the tag default''s reason as it holds now (#684)\n\nThe pinning section said to publish an immutable tag but not that every\nrelease already is one: CI publishes the whole family under the version\nwithout its `v`, plus a `major.minor` tag that moves with each patch\nrelease. Say which to pin, and that the installed `vast` never chooses\nthe tag, so installing a release does not move the images.\n\nThe docstrings around the family''s projec