_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fred-labs","id":83823539,"login":"fred-labs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODIzNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/173bbf7617591fb33ae92d50ef4332b896312fde/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:12:24Z","email":"fred-labs@mailbox.org","name":"fred-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:12:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Ship the Create 3 message types in the framework image (#664)\n\nros2 bag records only topics whose message type it can load, so a scenario\nthat records a TurtleBot 4 stack''s Create 3 topics needs irobot_create_msgs\nin the scenario container, which runs this image by default.","tree":{"sha":"3cc4df305aac2028d25eaf8af6732164323544ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/trees/3cc4df305aac2028d25eaf8af6732164323544ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/commits/173bbf7617591fb33ae92d50ef4332b896312fde","verification":{"payload":"tree 3cc4df305aac2028d25eaf8af6732164323544ae\nparent c4ea4e77b38e21330268e74ee40f839e13ae2bd0\nauthor fred-labs <fred-labs@mailbox.org> 1790176344 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790176344 +0200\n\nShip the Create 3 message types in the framework image (#664)\n\nros2 bag records only topics whose message type it can load, so a scenario\nthat records a TurtleBot 4 stack''s Create 3 