wMDk1ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cps-test-lab/robovast/commit/367c2f2c9812881c1cd56a661551a09ce6e28769","sha":"367c2f2c9812881c1cd56a661551a09ce6e28769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/367c2f2c9812881c1cd56a661551a09ce6e28769"}],"sha":"d963eca6972c464c565ddcc8afb42232c00095d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/d963eca6972c464c565ddcc8afb42232c00095d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83823539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fred-labs","id":83823539,"login":"fred-labs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODIzNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/367c2f2c9812881c1cd56a661551a09ce6e28769/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:13:38Z","email":"fred-labs@mailbox.org","name":"fred-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:13:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Draw any configuration as a picture, with its file backgrounds from the panel that reads them (#639)\n\n`draw_config(campaign_id, config_name, run_id, source, frame, projection)`\nis a core MCP tool that renders what a configuration''s config view\ndraws -- its contribution''s markers -- plus, with `run_id`, that run''s\ntrack. The track is an even stride over the whole run, first pose to\nlast, and its label says how many of how many poses it shows; a reply\ncut at its size ceiling is refused rather than drawn as the run. Side\nprojections (`xz`, `yz`) draw an arm or a drone from the side; a marker\nrises from its footprint on the floor, as in the 3D scene.\n\nA contributed file is drawn only by the package that knows its format,\nthrough the seam that already registers it for the browser: a\n`robovast.panel_types` config panel may declare `FILE_ROLE` and\n`plot(ax, path, projection, read)`. `read` returns a campaign file''s\nbytes by its campaign-relative path, so a format naming sibling files\nfetches them the same way. robovast_nav''s `Map2DPanelType` draws the\noccupancy map for role `map`, top-down only. A role no installed panel\ndraws, a projection a panel declines, and a contribution error are\nprinted on the image, since it has nowhere else to say them.\n\nThe rendering lives in `common/config_plot.py` and needs matplotlib,\ncore''s optional `analysis` extra; without it the tool names the extra.\n`data_access.query` passes `max_bytes` through for callers that consume\nrows rather than read them. robovast_nav''s `draw_map` is replaced and\nlisted as retired.","tree":{"sha":"c0b99c8c99672489ca4a5e5e00353650aa24f454","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/trees/c0b99c8c99672489ca4a5e5e00353650aa24f454"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/commits/367c2f2c9812881c1cd56a661551a09ce6e28769","verification":{"payload":"tree c0b99c8c99672489ca4a5e5e00353650aa24f454\nparent a1d73a25d05c329746abb166d02af5ed30b64628\nauthor fred-labs <fred-labs@mailbox.org> 1790111618 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790111618 +0200\n\nDraw any configuration as a picture, with its file backgrounds from the panel that reads them (#639)\n\n`draw_config(campaign_id, config_name, run_id, source, frame, projection)`\nis a core MCP tool that renders what a configuration''s config view\ndraws -- its contribution''s markers -- plus, with `run_id`, that run''s\ntrack. The track is an even stride over the whole run, first pose to\nlast, and its label says how many of how many poses it shows; a reply\ncut at its size ceiling is refused rather than drawn as the run. Side\nprojections (`xz`, `yz`) draw an arm or a drone from the side; a marker\nrises from its footprint on the floor, as in the 3D scene.\n\nA contributed file is drawn only by the package that knows its format,\nthrough the seam that already registers it for the browser: a\n`robovast.panel_types` config panel may declare `FILE_ROLE` and\n`plot(ax, path, projection, read)`. `read` returns a campaign file''s\nbytes by its campaign-relative path, so a format naming sibling files\nfetches them the same way. robovast_nav''s `Map2DPanelType` draws the\noccupancy map for role `map`, top-down only. A role no installed panel\ndraws, a projection a panel declines, and a contribution error are\nprinted on the image, since it has nowhere else to say them.\n\nThe rendering lives in `common/config_plot.py` and needs matplotlib,\ncore''s optional `analysis` extra; without it the tool names the extra.\n`data_access.query` passes `max_bytes` through for callers that consume\nrows rather than read them. robovast_nav''s `draw_map` is replaced and\nlisted as retired.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsu+CCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEYoQADW8buZiiSmcCScmg993B5CY\nAMkkRNHcDFgS9cjWpxtAaVS9I1atdeSsan+aTeSZfUvWhL1E2jf5l1OUvQe/LFm7\nJKIybAWL+Gnq+OD0fCA8K//U7a35CdYGWt/wjSFrps61qtoJlTuvQfSuNwUSwoCg\nM9nGsbakV7y0vJNB0/qYCqqRmy0A6lEbw3aO/ZFF6YOt6jxDAmrPxxa26fYA/np/\n25YKLrnra2u49cVO8E2vM9biLibKxNvFnozc57q+EXsMr6L1wO2E2EW5j6KjEfq3\na/6UwWG8e2aoHXOt2nag8kRev2cteWOxkVbkpAuWXqTFjQLAnkr0W85UaNQpyPPB\n9SvBoxVmLIAU29J3pv2xSHC9ZS3dmPwGrYjPrPJ4zRjMqEf24uiak3i2w/L+8awM\n2HuRhoWdLGig8zKj6HWycX