url":"https://github.com/cps-test-lab/robovast/commit/001ccabb700f767495ebd7f18dd3957ddae318f9","sha":"001ccabb700f767495ebd7f18dd3957ddae318f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/001ccabb700f767495ebd7f18dd3957ddae318f9"}],"sha":"249dd0c61f36a35f6e780e38d94affbb90e042e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/249dd0c61f36a35f6e780e38d94affbb90e042e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83823539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fred-labs","id":83823539,"login":"fred-labs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODIzNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/001ccabb700f767495ebd7f18dd3957ddae318f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T11:43:14Z","email":"fred-labs@mailbox.org","name":"fred-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T11:43:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Resolve a run''s job through the job-link manifest, not its symlink (#626)\n\nA run''s job is the directory its host record lives in, and two readers found it\nonly through the run''s `job` symlink: read_sysinfo, for the campaign''s metadata\nrecord, and read_run_job, for the `job` table and the index''s host columns. A batch\nmakes those symlinks only once it ends, so a campaign stopped after its runs\nfinished has none. Metadata generation then raised on the first complete run, and\nthe campaign could not be marked postprocessed although its derived data was\ncomplete; read_run_job quietly recorded each run as its own job with no host.\n\nBoth lanes write the job-link manifest before the first job starts, and every other\nreader already resolves through it. run_job_dir resolves a run''s job through the\nmanifest, the symlink only for a campaign recorded before it, and both readers use\nit. A caller walking every run reads the manifest once and passes it down.","tree":{"sha":"84346f7f19ba3c3ddf2eca96b2ad4739dcbd492e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/trees/84346f7f19ba3c3ddf2eca96b2ad4739dcbd492e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/commits/001ccabb700f767495ebd7f18dd3957ddae318f9","verification":{"payload":"tree 84346f7f19ba3c3ddf2eca96b2ad4739dcbd492e\nparent 616f9f7c16f248fe50e93f1606fe21adb4892d5c\nauthor fred-labs <fred-labs@mailbox.org> 1789990994 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789990994 +0200\n\nResolve a run''s job through the job-link manifest, not its symlink (#626)\n\nA run''s job is the directory its host record lives in, and two readers found it\nonly through the run''s `job` symlink: read_sysinfo, for the campaign''s metadata\nrecord, and read_run_job, for the `job` table and the index''s host columns. A batch\nmakes those symlinks only once it ends, so a campaign stopped after its runs\nfinished has none. Metadata generation then raised on the first complete run, and\nthe campaign could not be marked postprocessed although its derived data was\ncomplete; read_run_job quietly recorded each run as its own job with no host.\n\nBoth lanes write the job-link manifest before the first job starts, and every other\nreader already resolves through it. run_job_dir resolves a run''s job through the\nmanifest, the symlink only for a campaign recorded before it, and both readers use\nit. A caller walking every run reads the manifest once and passes it down.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsRhSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGvgQAFgUZ1fmJBuslLXA0UkGs35u\noP7+wjHl8a6XXtX3KmT2GeaI1JjP+OMU/oJ7GfYY4okp7svMfnVV9Du/XHKnFDEz\nctIN78pptWQ5+++Fl8m12SUb3Eo2AMaxIVypzZ7gVzzgl03IpHEkC/qkI1QBIU1D\nYYiVJK/kjjNKLvLtlwXa5fcSiqv+niJ9qq3PIWr+fwslzfaMz/IzhPfSEF9lBWl2\noZM3ZW21pKHCYatbEaU7IzWiHTWxy5P+pN14MOYXDdYFK6obfQIarmslCUAvSBzD\nB0uBbhSWHXHkYo2LMK7Eu4qRWVpDfBmLOvaz1gTMZMYQYSQIp8h/X0KHelIoHcVV\nixkJoLhfHKY7eVcvNkLkdQb3A97fcQBwdDyfKvaWfwu8zMi5tBSUyz3q67HnrZoI\nsUQvYr6mmXyHBqZOijpj8ZKJJSoT7A+Y/YL+RiUce7iK84My/kYKU9TRpXXLMz1J\n3E6RQlnG7Xxgj/tLhEVxD1VFpfCRrWJ/fh/cd5fqZYlfcnWyBmvyEgMuw5XwspLG\ndyvSqEhnldjfkHmdgHXc0LBU51Nj0v0NgE4wlGxKsdz3MEF0zFvE+kFqD/fGDFjF\nIoSMvVvtXvbU1YNfOk3SPfFf4c3W4JwzAyyeKuOTgHacSqVxjbms/dGQtnvaXytD\nA6AZhfTTz4EnX4GgDlGM\n=/FLf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T11:43:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cps-test-lab/robovast/commit/001ccabb700f767495ebd7f18dd3957ddae318f9","node_id":"C_kwDOPVaL7doAKDAwMWNjYWJiNzAwZjc2NzQ5NWViZDdmMThkZDM5NTdkZGFlMzE4Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cps-test-lab/robovast/commit/616f9f7c16f248fe50e93f1606fe21adb4892d5c","sha":"616f9f7c16f248fe50e93f1606fe21adb4892d5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/616f9f7c16f248fe50e93f1606fe21adb4892d5c"}],"sha":"001ccabb700f767495ebd7f18dd3957ddae318f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/001ccabb700f767495ebd7f18dd3957ddae318f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83823539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fred-labs","id":83823539,"login":"fred-labs","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODIzNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fred-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/commits/616f9f7c16f248fe50e93f1606fe21adb4892d5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T11:34:51Z","email":"fred-labs@mailbox.org","name":"fred-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T11:34:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"A campaign card shows whether the share already holds it (#625)\n\nThe card header gets a small cloud after the campaign id, read from the\nshare listing the page already fetches for \"Copy share link\": a cloud\nwith a check where the share holds the postprocessed archive, a hollow\ncloud where it holds only the raw campaign-end upload. The hover names\nevery variant the share holds, so a campaign on the share twice says so.\n\nThe slot is kept on every card so folded rows stay in columns, and a\nshare that is unconfigured or unreachable leaves it empty rather than\nrecording anything on the campaign: the share''s own listing stays the\none source for what it holds.","tree":{"sha":"1736173904f47bbc04603c288d572d74937f769f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/trees/1736173904f47bbc04603c288d572d74937f769f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cps-test-lab/robovast/git/commits/616f9f7c16f248fe50e93f1606fe21adb4892d5c","verification":{"payload":"tree 1736173904f47bbc04603c288d572d74937f769f\nparent f989ac134aac06121b4130329f0a45e62269885b\nauthor fred-labs <fred-labs@mailbox.org> 1789990491 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789990491 +0200\n\nA campaign card shows whether the share already holds it (#625)\n\nThe card header gets a small cloud after the campaign id, read from the\nshare listing the page already fetches for \"Copy share link\": a cloud\nwith a check where the share holds the postprocessed archive, a hollow\ncloud where it holds only the raw campaign-end upload. The hover names\nevery variant the share holds, so a campaign on the share twice says so.\n\nThe slot is kept on every card so folded rows stay in columns, and a\nshare that is unconfigured or unreachable leaves it empty rather than\nrecording anything on the campaign: the share''s own listing stays the\none source for what it holds.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsRZbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARfIQAEGuqM9PQH8RyyfUwU3YX8w9\nypoFlud3+8hcQNcxTKt7zXQsnzU0XXXtP2zGEGyji