 descarga en un solo click. El\nbackend sigue exigiendo validation_token (no hay endpoint de\ndescarga directa), así que esa llamada se mantiene por debajo, pero\nmanual_approved siempre se envía como true sin intervención humana\nreal -- coherente con que el backend nunca verificaba esa casilla,\nsolo comprobaba el booleano.","tree":{"sha":"bee41840f324f32574e6aa5f42f2a54503d7b0ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fmorondo/fmorondo.github.io/git/trees/bee41840f324f32574e6aa5f42f2a54503d7b0ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fmorondo/fmorondo.github.io/git/commits/77e58da154660dd3ebe175a7d550eb93f69b3d38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213096397?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fmorondo","id":213096397,"login":"fmorondo","node_id":"U_kgDODLOXzQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fmorondo/fmorondo.github.io/commit/77e58da154660dd3ebe175a7d550eb93f69b3d38","node_id":"C_kwDOPVjcZNoAKDc3ZTU4ZGExNTQ2NjBkZDNlYmUxNzVhN2Q1NTBlYjkzZjY5YjNkMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fmorondo/fmorondo.github.io/commit/6103cefe431845c60c7df6d7a235bf409edecab9","sha":"6103cefe431845c60c7df6d7a235bf409edecab9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fmorondo/fmorondo.github.io/commits/6103cefe431845c60c7df6d7a235bf409edecab9"}],"sha":"77e58da154660dd3ebe175a7d550eb93f69b3d38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fmorondo/fmorondo.github.io/commits/77e58da154660dd3ebe175a7d550eb93f69b3d38"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213096397?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fmorondo","id":213096397,"login":"fmorondo","node_id":"U_kgDODLOXzQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fmorondo/fmorondo.github.io/commits/6103cefe431845c60c7df6d7a235bf409edecab9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T22:10:52Z","email":"fmorondo@gmail.com","name":"Fernando Hernández"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T22:10:52Z","email":"fmorondo@gmail.com","name":"Fernando Hernández"},"message":"Progreso real en descargas y subida, sin tocar backend\n\n- descargar-audio.html y descargar-video.html: la descarga del blob\n  (MP3/MP4) se lee por streaming con response.body.getReader() y el\n  porcentaje se calcula contra el header Content-Length, en vez de\n  saltar directamente al 100%. Si el backend no manda Content-Length,\n  se degrada al comportamiento anterior (blob() directo).\n- subidacsv.html: la subida del CSV pasa de fetch a XMLHttpRequest para\n  poder usar xhr.upload.onprogress (bytes reales enviados por el\n  navegador), mapeado a 0-90%; el 90-100% sigue siendo fijo porque\n  cubre el procesamiento en servidor, que no es medible desde cliente.\n- El paso /validate de descargar-video.html no cambia: es una única\n  petición/respuesta JSON sin bytes que trocear, así que no tiene\n  progreso real posible sin instrumentar el backend.\n- READMEs de los tres servicios actualizados para reflejar el cambio.","tree":{"sha":"422c16705f0c9cf7a700472fbe50e33e063d8d7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fmorondo/fmorondo.github.io/git/trees/422c16705f0c9cf7a700472fbe50e33e063d8d7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fmorondo/fmorondo.github.io/git/commits/6103cefe431845c60c7df6d7a235bf409edecab9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213096397?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fmorondo","id":213096397,"login":"fmorondo","node_id":"U_kgDODLOXzQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fmorondo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fmorondo/fmorondo.github.io/commit/6103cefe431845c60c7df6d7a235bf409edecab9","node_