rgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elianacris/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elianacris/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elianacris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elianacris/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elianacris","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elianacris/boilerplate-microfrontend/commits/5dbf1a9403fc7a18693e7021512c5d4ccc20f26f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-30T18:33:30Z","email":"elianacrisdeus@outlook.com","name":"elianacris"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-30T18:33:30Z","email":"elianacrisdeus@outlook.com","name":"elianacris"},"message":"feat: upgrade turbo to version 1.13.4 and add platform-specific binaries\n\n- Added package.json for turbo-linux-64 with version 1.13.4\n- Included LICENSE file for the turbo package under MPL-2.0\n- Created README.md for Turborepo with community and usage information\n- Implemented platform-specific binary execution in turbo/bin/turbo\n- Updated package.json for turbo with optional dependencies for various platforms\n- Updated package-lock.json to reflect the new turbo version and its dependencies\n- Modified root package.json to use turbo for dev and build scripts\n- Added base TypeScript configuration in packages/tsconfig/base.json\n- Configured PostCSS for UI package with Tailwind CSS and Autoprefixer\n- Developed a Button component in the UI package using Material-UI\n- Created index.ts for UI package to export components and theme\n- Defined a Material-UI theme in packages/ui/src/theme/muiTheme.ts\n- Configured Tailwind CSS in packages/ui/tailwind.config.js\n- Added turbo.json for pipeline configuration in Turborepo","tree":{"sha":"b3b8b53d843c9f7600c81d3d65dbe31930592544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elianacris/boilerplate-microfrontend/git/trees/b3b8b53d843c9f7600c81d3d65dbe31930