il.com","name":"Madandola Hammed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-03T16:37:50Z","email":"aramicrown@gmail.com","name":"Madandola Hammed"},"message":"Release version 1.1.0 with npm publish\n\n- Updated version to 1.1.0 across all build artifacts\n- Published @ankabit/micro-framework to npm registry\n- Final build artifacts with enhanced auto-binding performance\n- Complete distribution files (UMD, ESM, CommonJS, minified)","tree":{"sha":"0870f805b03a56d7462e767c8f396ff226068db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankabit/micro-framework/git/trees/0870f805b03a56d7462e767c8f396ff226068db5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankabit/micro-framework/git/commits/cf116ac7932444909389d55f4d94978470b1f072","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29895599?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aramics","id":29895599,"login":"Aramics","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODk1NTk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ankabit/micro-framework/commit/cf116ac7932444909389d55f4d94978470b1f072","node_id":"C_kwDOPVoQc9oAKGNmMTE2YWM3OTMyNDQ0OTA5Mzg5ZDU1ZjRkOTQ5Nzg0NzBiMWYwNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ankabit/micro-framework/commit/292cece41f95dc44b599fa2636b48274aabad116","sha":"292cece41f95dc44b599fa2636b48274aabad116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankabit/micro-framework/commits/292cece41f95dc44b599fa2636b48274aabad116"}],"sha":"cf116ac7932444909389d55f4d94978470b1f072","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankabit/micro-framework/commits/cf116ac7932444909389d55f4d94978470b1f072"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29895599?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aramics","id":29895599,"login":"Aramics","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODk1NTk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankabit/micro-framework/commits/292cece41f95dc44b599fa2636b48274aabad116/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-01T10:41:00Z","email":"aramicrown@gmail.com","name":"Madandola Hammed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-01T10:41:00Z","email":"aramicrown@gmail.com","name":"Madandola Hammed"},"message":"feat: Simplify auto-binding with ultra-fast performance\n\nAuto-Binding Improvements:\n- Simplify to single configurable linkSelector (default: [data-route])\n- Ultra-fast click handler with only 4 lines of code\n- Remove complex helper methods and multiple selector loops\n- Automatic fallback from data-route to href attribute\n- Works with any HTML element (a, button, div, etc.)\n\nPerformance Optimizations:\n- Single closest() call instead of multiple selector checks\n- No runtime URL parsing or external link validation\n- Minimal logic per click for maximum performance\n- Event delegation handles dynamic AJAX content automatically\n\nConfiguration:\n- autoBindLinks: true (default) - enable/disable auto-binding\n- linkSelector: ''[data-route]'' (default) - CSS selector for navigation\n- Customizable selectors for different attribute patterns\n\nDocumentation:\n- Add comprehensive Auto-Binding Navigation section\n- Update configuration options with new settings\n- Enhanced code examples showing data-route usage\n- Document performance benefits and flexibility\n- Update features list to highlight auto-binding\n\nDeveloper Experience:\n- Zero-config navigation with data-route attributes\n- Works seamlessly with dynamic content from AJAX calls\n- Consistent behavior across all element types\n- Simple and intuitive API","tree":{"sha":"cbeae8891d28cbbbb5c866ae6f92decc183cfa64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankabit/micro-framework/git/trees/cbeae8891d28cbbbb5c866ae6f92decc183cfa64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankabit/micro-framework/git/commits/292cece41f95dc44b599fa2636b48274aabad116","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29895599?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aramics","id":29895599,"login":"Aramics","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODk1NTk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ankabit/micro-framework/commit/292cece41f95dc44b599fa2636b48274aabad116","node_id":"C_kwDOPVoQc9oAKDI5MmNlY2U0MWY5NWRjNDRiNTk5ZmEyNjM2YjQ4Mjc0YWFiYWQxMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ankabit/micro-framework/commit/42b897dc8f2e4fada6e6060b29ba930de18ab678","sha":"42b897dc8f2e4fada6e6060b29ba930de18ab678","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankabit/micro-framework/commits/42b897dc8f2e4fada6e6060b29ba930de18ab678"}],"sha":"292cece41f95dc44b599fa2636b48274aabad116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankabit/micro-framework/commits/292cece41f95dc44b599fa2636b48274aabad116"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29895599?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aramics","id":29895599,"login":"Aramics","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODk1NTk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aramics","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankabit/micro-framework/commits/42b897dc8f2e4fada6e6060b29ba930de18ab678/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-01T09:23:48Z","email":"aramicrown@gmail.com","name":"Madandola Hammed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-01T09:23:48Z","email":"aramicrown@gmail.com","name":"Madandola Hammed"},"message":"feat: Add robust container handling and enhanced route events\n\nContainer Management:\n- Add automatic stale container detection using MutationObserver\n- Implement container re-initialization and recovery when DOM changes\n- Add simplified render() method supporting strings, elements, and functions\n- Provide container lifecycle events (removed, recovered, recovery_failed)\n- Replace getValidContainer() with cleaner getContainer() API\n\nRoute Events:\n- Add ROUTE_WILL_CHANGE event that fires before navigation starts\n- Improve route lifecycle documentation with complete event sequence\n- Enable better analytics tracking and loading indicator integration\n\nAPI Improvements:\n- Add context.render() method for route handlers and modules\n- Simplify container access patterns across the framework\n- Enhance error handling with fallback error display\n- Update all internal code to use new container API\n\nDocumentation:\n- Add comprehensive container handling section to README\n- Document complete route event lifecycle with examples\n- Update all code examples to use new render() API\n- Add container events to events documentation\n- Update CHANGELOG with detailed feature descriptions\n\nThis update provides a much more robust and developer-friendly API for\ncontainer management while maintaining backward compatibility and adding\npowerful new lifecycle events for better application control.","tree":{"sha":"a086f5afc10af6697e2461459dc4e5782fc57422","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankabit/micro-framework/git/trees/a086f5afc10af6697e2461459dc4e5782fc57422"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ankabit/micro-framework/git/commits/42b897dc8f2e4fada6e6060b29ba930de18ab678","verification":{"payload":null,